## Decisions and Action Items

1. **`draft-ietf-grow-bmp-tlv`**: Extend Working Group Last Call by one week to collect remaining feedback and address review comments submitted by Mukul Srivastava and others.
2. **`draft-ietf-grow-bmp-rel` & GEN Merge**: Proceed with structural merge where `draft-ietf-grow-bmp-rel` defines the core event framework for BMP v4 and GEN acts as an application extension.
3. **`draft-ietf-grow-bmp-adj-ribs-filtered`**: Update text to relax mandatory Peer Down/Peer Up state resets during filter policy updates, permitting delta route monitoring messages where supported.
4. **`draft-ietf-grow-bmp-yang`**: Resolve final editorial items and issue a Working Group Last Call request.

